OL,3,GNEWSAJury considers verdict in boy's
OL,4,Astabbing murder trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury has been sent out to consider
OL,7,Fits verdict in the trial of a teenager
OL,8,Faccused of stabbing a 14-year-old boy
OL,9,Fto death in a pre-arranged fight on the
OL,10,FIsle of Man.
OL,12,FThe 16-year-old, who cannot be named
OL,13,Fdue to his age, denies murdering
OL,14,FChristopher McBurnie in Ramsey on 29
OL,15,FMay 2025.
OL,17,FClosing the prosecution's case on
OL,18,FWednesday, David Temkin KC said the
OL,19,Fstabbing had been "unlawful, deliberate
OL,20,Fand frenzied".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
